    "AMD 顯示卡加速下載好了，重新開啟拾音後，轉錄就會用顯示卡": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AMD GPU acceleration is ready. Reopen Shiyin and transcription will use the GPU."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AMD 显卡加速下载好了，重新打开拾音后，转录就会用显卡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AMD 顯示卡加速（Vulkan）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AMD GPU acceleration (Vulkan)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AMD 显卡加速（Vulkan）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AMD、Intel 顯示卡加速（Vulkan）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AMD and Intel GPU acceleration (Vulkan)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AMD、Intel 显卡加速（Vulkan）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API key 存在 Windows 的認證管理員，不會寫進任何檔案。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API keys are stored in Windows Credential Manager and never written to any file."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API key 存在 Windows 的凭据管理器，不会写进任何文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Breeze ASR 25（建議）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Breeze ASR 25 (recommended)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Breeze ASR 25（建议）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU（Intel 顯示卡沒通過檢查）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CPU (the Intel GPU didn’t pass the check)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CPU（Intel 显卡没通过检查）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU（Intel 顯示卡還沒檢查）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CPU (the Intel GPU hasn’t been checked yet)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CPU（Intel 显卡还没检查）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code、Claude Desktop、Codex 等支援 MCP 的 AI 工具可以搜尋、讀你的會議紀錄和逐字稿（只能讀、不能改），拾音不用開著。讀到的內容會交給那個 AI 工具處理，跟整理會議紀錄一樣會離開這台電腦。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI tools that support MCP, such as Claude Code, Claude Desktop and Codex, can search and read your meeting notes and transcripts (read-only), even when Shiyin isn't open. What they read is handled by that AI tool and leaves this PC, just like when meeting notes are written."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code、Claude Desktop、Codex 等支持 MCP 的 AI 工具可以搜索、读你的会议记录和逐字稿（只能读、不能改），拾音不用开着。读到的内容会交给那个 AI 工具处理，跟整理会议记录一样会离开这台电脑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code、Claude Desktop、Codex 等支援 MCP 的 AI 工具可以直接讀拾音的會議：到「設定 → 進階 → AI 工具（MCP）」打開「讓 AI 工具讀取會議」，再按「加到 Claude Code」「加到 Codex」或「加到 Claude Desktop」。其他工具用「複製」自己貼上設定。拾音不用開著。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI tools that support MCP, such as Claude Code, Claude Desktop and Codex, can read your Shiyin meetings directly: in Settings › Advanced › AI tools (MCP), turn on “Let AI tools read meetings”, then click “Add to Claude Code”, “Add to Codex” or “Add to Claude Desktop”. For other tools, use Copy and paste the settings yourself. Shiyin doesn't need to be open."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code、Claude Desktop、Codex 等支持 MCP 的 AI 工具可以直接读拾音的会议：到“设置 → 高级 → AI 工具（MCP）”打开“让 AI 工具读取会议”，再按“加到 Claude Code”“加到 Codex”或“加到 Claude Desktop”。其他工具用“复制”自己粘贴设置。拾音不用开着。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code（這台電腦已經裝了 claude CLI）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
