    "Intel 顯示卡加速下載好了，重新開啟拾音後，下一次轉錄會先檢查顯示卡是不是比較快，是的話就改用顯示卡": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intel GPU acceleration is ready. Reopen Shiyin and the next transcription will first check whether the GPU is faster, and use it if it is."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intel 显卡加速下载好了，重新打开拾音后，下一次转录会先检查显卡是不是比较快，是的话就改用显卡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
