          }
        }
      }
    },
    "即時逐字稿和快速辨識用，約 240 MB。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Used for the live transcript and Quick recognition, about 240 MB."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时逐字稿和快速识别用，约 240 MB。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只能讀、不能改；垃圾桶裡的會議、正在錄的會議讀不到。讀到的會議內容會交給那個 AI 工具處理，跟整理會議紀錄一樣會離開這台電腦；關掉開關就讀不到了。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read-only: AI tools can't change anything, and meetings in the Trash or still being recorded aren't available. The meeting content they read is handled by that AI tool and leaves this PC, just like when meeting notes are written. Turn the switch off to stop access."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只能读、不能改；回收站里的会议、正在录的会议读不到。读到的会议内容会交给那个 AI 工具处理，跟整理会议记录一样会离开这台电脑；关掉开关就读不到了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
