    "拾音：錄音中 %@，%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin: recording %@, %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拾音：录音中 %@，%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「停止並轉錄」後，拾音會在這台電腦上重新轉錄（中文、英文用 Breeze ASR 25，%@用 Whisper large-v3-turbo，%@用 Qwen3-ASR），並分辨不同的說話者。等待的時候，會議紀錄會先用即時逐字稿整理一份草稿，正式版好了會自動換掉。逐字稿上點「說話者 1」可以改成人名，整場都會跟著改；拾音會記住這個人的聲音，之後的會議自動帶入名字（標「自動」，認錯了點一下就能改）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After you click Stop and transcribe, Shiyin transcribes again on this PC (Breeze ASR 25 for Chinese and English, Whisper large-v3-turbo for %@, Qwen3-ASR for %@) and tells the speakers apart. While you wait, a draft of the notes is written from the live transcript and replaced automatically when the final version is ready. Click “Speaker 1” in the transcript to give a real name and the whole meeting updates; Shiyin remembers that voice and fills in the name in later meetings (marked Auto — click it if it's wrong)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按“停止并转录”后，拾音会在这台电脑上重新转录（中文、英文用 Breeze ASR 25，%@用 Whisper large-v3-turbo，%@用 Qwen3-ASR），并分辨不同的说话者。等待的时候，会议记录会先用实时逐字稿整理一份草稿，正式版好了会自动换掉。逐字稿上点“说话者 1”可以改成人名，整场都会跟着改；拾音会记住这个人的声音，之后的会议自动带入名字（标“自动”，认错了点一下就能改）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「停止並轉錄」後，拾音會在這台電腦上重新轉錄（中文、英文用 Breeze ASR 25，日文用 Whisper large-v3-turbo），並分辨不同的說話者。等待的時候，會議紀錄會先用即時逐字稿整理一份草稿，正式版好了會自動換掉。逐字稿上點「說話者 1」可以改成人名，整場都會跟著改；拾音會記住這個人的聲音，之後的會議自動帶入名字（標「自動」，認錯了點一下就能改）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After you click Stop and transcribe, Shiyin transcribes again on this PC (Breeze ASR 25 for Chinese and English, Whisper large-v3-turbo for Japanese) and tells the speakers apart. While you wait, a draft of the notes is written from the live transcript and replaced automatically when the final version is ready. Click “Speaker 1” in the transcript to give a real name and the whole meeting updates; Shiyin remembers that voice and fills in the name in later meetings (marked Auto — click it if it's wrong)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按“停止并转录”后，拾音会在这台电脑上重新转录（中文、英文用 Breeze ASR 25，日文用 Whisper large-v3-turbo），并分辨不同的说话者。等待的时候，会议记录会先用实时逐字稿整理一份草稿，正式版好了会自动换掉。逐字稿上点“说话者 1”可以改成人名，整场都会跟着改；拾音会记住这个人的声音，之后的会议自动带入名字（标“自动”，认错了点一下就能改）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「開始使用」後就可以錄音或匯入了。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click Get started, then record or import."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按“开始使用”后就可以录音或导入了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按側欄上方的「錄音」（Ctrl+R）開始錄；點按鈕旁的箭頭可以選錄音來源和麥克風，線上會議請選「麥克風＋電腦聲音（線上會議）」，對方的聲音也會錄進來。錄音畫面會寫出正在用哪一支麥克風，點一下可以換；藍牙耳機連著時 Windows 可能自動改用耳機的麥克風，拾音會提醒你。已經有錄音檔的話，拖進視窗、按「匯入」（Ctrl+O），或在檔案總管按右鍵用拾音開啟都可以。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click Record at the top of the sidebar (Ctrl+R) to start. The arrow next to it chooses the source and microphone — for online meetings pick “Microphone + computer audio (online meeting)” so the other side is recorded too. While recording, the microphone in use is shown and you can click it to switch; if a Bluetooth headset is connected, Windows may switch to its microphone, and Shiyin will let you know. If you already have a recording, drag it into the window, click Import (Ctrl+O), or right-click it in File Explorer and open it with Shiyin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按侧边栏上方的“录音”（Ctrl+R）开始录；点按钮旁的箭头可以选录音来源和麦克风，线上会议请选“麦克风＋电脑声音（线上会议）”，对方的声音也会录进来。录音画面会写出正在用哪一支麦克风，点一下可以换；蓝牙耳机连着时 Windows 可能自动改用耳机的麦克风，拾音会提醒你。已经有录音文件的话，拖进窗口、按“导入”（Ctrl+O），或在文件资源管理器按右键用拾音打开都可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按側欄上方的「錄音」（Ctrl+R）開始錄；點按鈕旁的箭頭可以選錄音來源，線上會議請選「麥克風＋電腦聲音（線上會議）」，對方的聲音也會錄進來。已經有錄音檔的話，拖進視窗、按「匯入」（Ctrl+O），或在檔案總管按右鍵用拾音開啟都可以。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click Record at the top of the sidebar (Ctrl+R) to start. The arrow next to it chooses the source — for online meetings pick “Microphone + computer audio (online meeting)” so the other side is recorded too. If you already have a recording, drag it into the window, click Import (Ctrl+O), or right-click it in File Explorer and open it with Shiyin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按侧边栏上方的“录音”（Ctrl+R）开始录；点按钮旁的箭头可以选录音来源，线上会议请选“麦克风＋电脑声音（线上会议）”，对方的声音也会录进来。已经有录音文件的话，拖进窗口、按“导入”（Ctrl+O），或在文件资源管理器按右键用拾音打开都可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按右上角的「匯出」（Ctrl+E）：會議紀錄可以存成 Markdown、PDF、Word，心智圖可以存成 PNG、PDF、SVG；逐字稿可以存成 txt、srt、vtt、Word；錄音可以存成 m4a、wav；「整場會議（.shiyin）」可以傳給同事，對方雙擊就能匯入（Mac 版也可以）。「匯出」旁邊的箭頭可以直接複製會議紀錄或心智圖的圖片，貼到 Notion、Slack 或郵件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click Export at the top right (Ctrl+E): notes can be saved as Markdown, PDF or Word, and the mind map as PNG, PDF or SVG; transcripts as txt, srt, vtt or Word; recordings as m4a or wav. Send a “Whole meeting (.shiyin)” to a colleague and they can import it with a double-click (on the Mac version too). The arrow next to Export copies the notes, or the mind map as an image, so you can paste them straight into Notion, Slack or email."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按右上角的“导出”（Ctrl+E）：会议记录可以存成 Markdown、PDF、Word，心智图可以存成 PNG、PDF、SVG；逐字稿可以存成 txt、srt、vtt、Word；录音可以存成 m4a、wav；“整场会议（.shiyin）”可以传给同事，对方双击就能导入（Mac 版也可以）。“导出”旁边的箭头可以直接复制会议记录或心智图的图片，贴到 Notion、Slack 或邮件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按右上角的「匯出」（Ctrl+E）：會議紀錄可以存成 Markdown、PDF、Word；逐字稿可以存成 txt、srt、vtt、Word；錄音可以存成 m4a、wav；「整場會議（.shiyin）」可以傳給同事，對方雙擊就能匯入（Mac 版也可以）。「匯出」旁邊的箭頭可以直接複製會議紀錄，貼到 Notion、Slack 或郵件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click Export at the top right (Ctrl+E): notes can be saved as Markdown, PDF or Word; transcripts as txt, srt, vtt or Word; recordings as m4a or wav. Send a “Whole meeting (.shiyin)” to a colleague and they can import it with a double-click (on the Mac version too). The arrow next to Export copies the notes so you can paste them straight into Notion, Slack or email."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按右上角的“导出”（Ctrl+E）：会议记录可以存成 Markdown、PDF、Word；逐字稿可以存成 txt、srt、vtt、Word；录音可以存成 m4a、wav；“整场会议（.shiyin）”可以传给同事，对方双击就能导入（Mac 版也可以）。“导出”旁边的箭头可以直接复制会议记录，贴到 Notion、Slack 或邮件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "掃描的 PDF、圖片用 Windows 的文字辨識讀出文字（要有會議語言的辨識：設定 → 時間與語言 → 語言與地區）。一場會議的文件合計最多 4 萬字，太長的只送前面的部分。Keynote、Pages 請先匯出成 PDF。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text in scanned PDFs and images is read with Windows text recognition (it needs recognition for the meeting language: Settings → Time & language → Language & region). A meeting's documents can total up to 40,000 characters; for longer ones only the beginning is sent. Export Keynote and Pages files as PDF first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描的 PDF、图片用 Windows 的文字识别读出文字（要有会议语言的识别：设置 → 时间与语言 → 语言与地区）。一场会议的文档合计最多 4 万字，太长的只送前面的部分。Keynote、Pages 请先导出成 PDF。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "播放": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "播放"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "改用 %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改用 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "放大、縮小會議內容的文字": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Make meeting text bigger or smaller"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放大、缩小会议内容的文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理、提問、猜說話者時會把逐字稿文字、你的筆記、詞彙表和會議基本資料送到這台電腦上的服務（%@），不會離開電腦。錄音檔不會送出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When writing notes, answering questions and guessing speakers, the transcript text, your notes, the glossary and basic meeting info are sent to a service on this PC (%@) and never leave it. Recordings are never sent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整理、提问、猜说话者时会把逐字稿文字、你的笔记、词汇表和会议基本资料送到这台电脑上的服务（%@），不会离开电脑。录音文件不会送出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暫停錄音（Ctrl+Shift+P）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pause recording (Ctrl+Shift+P)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂停录音（Ctrl+Shift+P）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "更新金鑰不符": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "the update key doesn't match"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新密钥不符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "替說話者取名時，拾音會記下這個人的聲音特徵。之後的會議認出同一個人，就自動帶入名字並標「自動」，不對可以改。聲音特徵只存在這台電腦的資料庫，不會上傳，也不會放進匯出的 .shiyin 封包。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you name a speaker, Shiyin saves that person's voice features. When it recognizes the same person in a later meeting, it fills in the name and marks it Auto; you can change it if it's wrong. Voice features stay in the database on this PC — never uploaded and never included in exported .shiyin packages."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "替说话者取名时，拾音会记下这个人的声音特征。之后的会议认出同一个人，就自动带入名字并标“自动”，不对可以改。声音特征只存在这台电脑的数据库，不会上传，也不会放进导出的 .shiyin 文件包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會參考詞彙表，中英夾雜、專有名詞比較準；需要下載約 1.7 GB 的模型。日文會議改用 Whisper large-v3-turbo（574 MB）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses your glossary and handles mixed Chinese and English and proper nouns better; downloads a model of about 1.7 GB. Japanese meetings use Whisper large-v3-turbo (574 MB) instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会参考词汇表，中英夹杂、专有名词比较准；需要下载约 1.7 GB 的模型。日文会议改用 Whisper large-v3-turbo（574 MB）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會參考詞彙表，多人會議的漏字和同音字比 Breeze 少；阿里巴巴開源的模型，全程在這台電腦上跑、不連網，輸出會轉成台灣繁體；需要下載約 2.5 GB 的模型和 llama.cpp 的執行檔。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses your glossary; fewer dropped words and homophone errors than Breeze in multi-speaker meetings. An open-source model from Alibaba that runs entirely on this PC without network access; output is converted to Taiwanese Traditional Chinese. Downloads about 2.5 GB of model files plus the llama.cpp program."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会参考词汇表，多人会议的漏字和同音字比 Breeze 少；阿里巴巴开源的模型，全程在这台电脑上跑、不连网，输出会转成台湾繁体；需要下载约 2.5 GB 的模型和 llama.cpp 的可执行文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會參考詞彙表，多人會議的漏字和同音字比 Breeze 少；阿里巴巴開源的模型，全程在這台電腦上跑、不連網，輸出會轉成台灣繁體；需要下載約 2.5 GB 的模型和 llama.cpp 的執行檔。日文會議改用 Whisper large-v3-turbo（574 MB）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses your glossary; fewer dropped words and homophone errors than Breeze in multi-speaker meetings. An open-source model from Alibaba that runs entirely on this PC without network access; output is converted to Taiwanese Traditional Chinese. Downloads about 2.5 GB of model files plus the llama.cpp program. Japanese meetings use Whisper large-v3-turbo (574 MB) instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会参考词汇表，多人会议的漏字和同音字比 Breeze 少；阿里巴巴开源的模型，全程在这台电脑上跑、不连网，输出会转成台湾繁体；需要下载约 2.5 GB 的模型和 llama.cpp 的可执行文件。日文会议改用 Whisper large-v3-turbo（574 MB）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
