    },
    "會議可以分資料夾：在會議上按右鍵（或「更多」）選「移到資料夾」→「新資料夾…」。正在看某個資料夾時，新錄的和匯入的會議都會放進去。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meetings can go in folders: right-click a meeting (or use More) and choose Move to folder → New folder…. While you're viewing a folder, new recordings and imports go into it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会议可以分文件夹：在会议上按右键（或“更多”）选“移到文件夹”→“新文件夹…”。正在看某个文件夹时，新录的和导入的会议都会放进去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會議日期：依各檔案的檔名或修改日期": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeting date: from each file's name or modification date"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会议日期：依各文件的文件名或修改日期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 AMD 顯示卡、選了 Qwen3-ASR 時自動下載，Qwen 改用顯示卡轉錄。%@，解開約 %@（llama.cpp 官方的 Vulkan 版）。刪除後不會再自動下載。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloaded automatically when this PC has an AMD GPU and Qwen3-ASR is selected, so Qwen transcribes on the GPU. %@, about %@ unpacked (the official llama.cpp Vulkan build). Once deleted, it won’t be downloaded again automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有 AMD 显卡、选了 Qwen3-ASR 时自动下载，Qwen 改用显卡转录。%@，解开约 %@（llama.cpp 官方的 Vulkan 版）。删除后不会再自动下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 AMD 顯示卡時自動下載，正式轉錄改用顯示卡。%@，解開約 %@（拾音用同一版 whisper.cpp 建的 Vulkan 版）。刪除後不會再自動下載。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloaded automatically when this PC has an AMD GPU, so final transcription runs on the GPU. %@, about %@ unpacked (a Vulkan build Shiyin makes from the same whisper.cpp version). Once deleted, it won’t be downloaded again automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有 AMD 显卡时自动下载，正式转录改用显卡。%@，解开约 %@（拾音用同一版 whisper.cpp 建的 Vulkan 版）。删除后不会再自动下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 Intel 顯示卡時自動下載。第一次正式轉錄時，先用這場錄音的一段比對顯示卡和 CPU，結果一樣、顯示卡又比較快才改用顯示卡。%@，解開約 %@（拾音用同一版 whisper.cpp 建的 Vulkan 版）。刪除後不會再自動下載。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloaded automatically when this PC has an Intel GPU. The first final transcription compares the GPU with the CPU on part of that recording, and switches to the GPU only if the results match and the GPU is faster. %@, about %@ unpacked (a Vulkan build Shiyin makes from the same whisper.cpp version). Once deleted, it won’t be downloaded again automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有 Intel 显卡时自动下载。第一次正式转录时，先用这场录音的一段比对显卡和 CPU，结果一样、显卡又比较快才改用显卡。%@，解开约 %@（拾音用同一版 whisper.cpp 建的 Vulkan 版）。删除后不会再自动下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 NVIDIA 顯示卡、選了 Qwen3-ASR 時自動下載，Qwen 的轉錄會快很多。272 MB，解開約 610 MB（llama.cpp 官方的 CUDA 版，要先有上面的 NVIDIA 顯示卡加速）。刪除後不會再自動下載。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloaded automatically when you have an NVIDIA GPU and choose Qwen3-ASR; makes Qwen transcription much faster. 272 MB, about 610 MB unpacked (the official llama.cpp CUDA build; requires the NVIDIA GPU acceleration above). It is not downloaded again after you delete it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有 NVIDIA 显卡、选了 Qwen3-ASR 时自动下载，Qwen 的转录会快很多。272 MB，解开约 610 MB（llama.cpp 官方的 CUDA 版，要先有上面的 NVIDIA 显卡加速）。删除后不会再自动下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 NVIDIA 顯示卡時自動下載，轉錄會快很多。685 MB，解開約 1.1 GB（whisper.cpp 官方的 CUDA 版）。刪除後不會再自動下載。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
