            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制会议记录：纯文本（贴到 Slack、消息）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "要先安裝並登入對應的 CLI。登入後可以在「設定 → 整理工具」按「測試整理工具」確認。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install and sign in to the CLI first. Then click Test in Settings → Notes engine to check it works."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要先安装并登录对应的 CLI。登录后可以在“设置 → 整理工具”按“测试整理工具”确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "覺得拾音好用的話，可以請我喝杯咖啡。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enjoying Shiyin? Buy me a coffee."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "觉得拾音好用的话，可以请我喝杯咖啡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者分得太少（人多、吵雜、手機放在桌上遠距收音）時，從「更多 → 重新處理」選「重新辨識說話者…」，告訴拾音大約幾個人。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If too few speakers were found (many people, noisy room, a phone on the table far from the speakers), choose More → Reprocess → Re-identify Speakers… and tell Shiyin roughly how many people there were."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "说话者分得太少（人多、吵杂、手机放在桌上远距收音）时，从“更多 → 重新处理”选“重新识别说话者…”，告诉拾音大约几个人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者分得太少（人多、吵雜、手機放在桌上遠距收音）時，從「更多」選「重新辨識說話者…」，告訴拾音大約幾個人。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If too few speakers were found (many people, noise, a phone on the table), choose More → Re-identify speakers… and tell Shiyin roughly how many people there were."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "说话者分得太少（人多、吵杂、手机放在桌上远距收音）时，从“更多”选“重新识别说话者…”，告诉拾音大约几个人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者分錯了：同一個人被分成兩位，點說話者的名字選「合併到…」；某幾句分錯人，在逐字稿按右鍵選「這句是誰說的」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If speakers are wrong: when one person was split into two, click the speaker's name and choose Merge into…; when a few lines have the wrong speaker, right-click them in the transcript and choose Who said this."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "说话者分错了：同一个人被分成两位，点说话者的名字选“合并到…”；某几句分错人，在逐字稿按右键选“这句是谁说的”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者辨識模型：分辨是誰在說話，約 46 MB": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speaker recognition model: tells who is speaking, about 46 MB"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "说话者识别模型：分辨是谁在说话，约 46 MB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者辨識用，約 46 MB。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Used for speaker recognition, about 46 MB."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "说话者识别用，约 46 MB。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者辨識的模型還在下載，下載好後再試一次": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The speaker recognition model is still downloading. Try again when it's ready"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "说话者识别的模型还在下载，下载好后再试一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "請到「設定 → 隱私權與安全性 → 麥克風」打開「麥克風存取」和「讓傳統型應用程式存取您的麥克風」，再重新開始錄音。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Go to Settings → Privacy & security → Microphone, turn on “Microphone access” and “Let desktop apps access your microphone”, then start recording again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请到“设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 麦克风”打开“麦克风访问”和“让传统型应用程序访问您的麦克风”，再重新开始录音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "讀不到認證管理員裡的 key（錯誤代碼 %lld）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't read the key from Credential Manager (error %lld)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读不到凭据管理器里的 key（错误代码 %lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "超過 15 秒沒有收到電腦的聲音：請確認線上會議有聲音在播": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No computer audio for over 15 seconds: check that the online meeting is playing sound"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超过 15 秒没有收到电脑的声音：请确认线上会议有声音在播"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "跟著 Windows": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Same as Windows"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟着 Windows"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉成逐字稿：在這台電腦上轉錄、分辨說話者，不會上傳。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcribe: transcription and speaker identification run on this PC; nothing is uploaded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转成逐字稿：在这台电脑上转录、分辨说话者，不会上传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完成、會議紀錄整理好時通知你。已允許。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifies you when transcription and meeting notes are done. Allowed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转录完成、会议记录整理好时通知你。已允许。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完成、會議紀錄整理好時通知你。通知被關掉時，可以在 Windows 的「系統 → 通知」打開。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifies you when transcription and meeting notes are done. If notifications are off, turn them on in Windows Settings → System → Notifications."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转录完成、会议记录整理好时通知你。通知被关掉时，可以在 Windows 的“系统 → 通知”打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完成後把錄音壓縮成 m4a（約每小時 43 MB）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compress recordings to m4a after transcription (about 43 MB per hour)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转录完成后把录音压缩成 m4a（约每小时 43 MB）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完會自動整理。「摘要」有重點、決議、待辦和未決問題；「詳細」依議題分段；每一條後面的時間點點一下，就從錄音那裡開始播放。範本選單可以換成一對一、訪談、課堂／演講、腦力激盪等格式，換完從「更多」選「重新整理會議紀錄」。想找某件事，可以在「提問」分頁直接問，回答會附上時間點；側欄上方的提問按鈕可以一次問所有會議。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes are written automatically after transcription. Summary has key points, decisions, action items and open questions; Details is split by topic; click the time after any item to play the recording from there. The template menu switches to formats like one-on-one, interview, lecture or brainstorm — then choose More → Regenerate meeting notes. To find something, ask in the Ask tab and the answer comes with timestamps; the Ask button at the top of the sidebar asks all meetings at once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转录完会自动整理。“摘要”有重点、决议、待办和未决问题；“详细”依议题分段；每一条后面的时间点点一下，就从录音那里开始播放。模板菜单可以换成一对一、访谈、课堂／演讲、脑力激荡等格式，换完从“更多”选“重新整理会议记录”。想找某件事，可以在“提问”标签页直接问，回答会附上时间点；侧边栏上方的提问按钮可以一次问所有会议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完會自動整理。「紀錄」分頁由上而下是摘要、決議、待辦、未決問題和依議題分段的討論；每一條後面的時間點點一下，就從錄音那裡開始播放。上方的「條列｜心智圖」可以把紀錄畫成心智圖，一眼看出有哪些議題。範本選單可以換成一對一、訪談、課堂／演講、腦力激盪等格式，換完從「更多 → 重新處理」選「重新整理會議紀錄」。想找某件事，可以在「提問」分頁直接問，回答會附上時間點；側欄上方的提問按鈕可以一次問所有會議。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes are generated automatically after transcription. The Notes tab shows, from top to bottom, the summary, decisions, action items, open questions, and the discussion by topic; click the timestamp after any item to play the recording from there. Switch “List | Mind map” at the top to draw the notes as a mind map and see every topic at a glance. The template menu switches to formats such as one-on-one, interview, lecture, or brainstorming; afterwards choose More → Reprocess → Regenerate Notes. To find something, ask in the Ask tab and the answer comes with timestamps; the Ask button above the sidebar asks across all meetings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转录完会自动整理。“记录”标签页由上而下是摘要、决议、待办、未决问题和依议题分段的讨论；每一条后面的时间点点一下，就从录音那里开始播放。上方的“条列｜心智图”可以把记录画成心智图，一眼看出有哪些议题。模板菜单可以换成一对一、访谈、课堂／演讲、脑力激荡等格式，换完从“更多 → 重新处理”选“重新整理会议记录”。想找某件事，可以在“提问”标签页直接问，回答会附上时间点；侧边栏上方的提问按钮可以一次问所有会议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完會自動整理。「紀錄」分頁由上而下是摘要、決議、待辦、未決問題和依議題分段的討論；每一條後面的時間點點一下，就從錄音那裡開始播放。範本選單可以換成一對一、訪談、課堂／演講、腦力激盪等格式，換完從「更多 → 重新處理」選「重新整理會議紀錄」。想找某件事，可以在「提問」分頁直接問，回答會附上時間點；側欄上方的提問按鈕可以一次問所有會議。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes are generated automatically after transcription. The Notes tab shows, from top to bottom, the summary, decisions, action items, open questions, and the discussion by topic; click the timestamp after any item to play the recording from there. The template menu switches to formats such as one-on-one, interview, lecture, or brainstorming; afterwards choose More → Reprocess → Regenerate Notes. To find something, ask in the Ask tab and the answer comes with timestamps; the Ask button above the sidebar asks across all meetings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转录完会自动整理。“记录”标签页由上而下是摘要、决议、待办、未决问题和依议题分段的讨论；每一条后面的时间点点一下，就从录音那里开始播放。模板菜单可以换成一对一、访谈、课堂／演讲、脑力激荡等格式，换完从“更多 → 重新处理”选“重新整理会议记录”。想找某件事，可以在“提问”标签页直接问，回答会附上时间点；侧边栏上方的提问按钮可以一次问所有会议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄模型下載中 %lld%%，下載好之前先用快速辨識轉錄。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
