            "value": "转录模型下载中 %lld%%，下载好之前先用快速识别转录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄模型還沒下載好，會先用快速辨識轉錄；可以到「設定 → 錄音與轉錄」下載，用模型轉錄比較準。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The transcription model is not downloaded yet, so fast recognition is used for now. You can download it in Settings → Recording & Transcription; the model is more accurate."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转录模型还没下载好，会先用快速识别转录；可以到“设置 → 录音与转录”下载，用模型转录比较准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄正在用這個元件，重新開啟拾音後才能刪除": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription is using this component. Reopen Shiyin to delete it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转录正在用这个元件，重新打开拾音后才能删除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄（快速辨識）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcribing (quick recognition)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转录（快速识别）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄：錄音會送到 %@（公司的伺服器），轉完就刪。說話者辨識也在伺服器上做，聲紋只存在這台電腦；筆記、會議紀錄不會因為轉錄送出。伺服器用的轉錄引擎：%@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription: recordings are sent to %1$@ (your company's server) and deleted after transcription. Speakers are also identified on the server; voiceprints stay on this computer, and notes and meeting notes are not sent for transcription. Transcription engine on the server: %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转录：录音会送到 %@（公司的服务器），转完就删。说话者识别也在服务器上做，声纹只存在这台电脑；笔记、会议记录不会因为转录送出。服务器用的转录引擎：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "逐字稿裡琥珀色的段落辨識信心比較低，值得回頭聽；時間軸上的三角形是待確認題目、圓點是你標的重點；時間軸上面的色塊是議題，點了從那個議題開始聽。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amber segments in the transcript have lower recognition confidence and are worth listening to again. On the timeline, triangles are questions to confirm and dots are your bookmarks; the colored blocks above it are topics — click one to listen from where that topic starts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐字稿里琥珀色的段落识别置信度比较低，值得回头听；时间轴上的三角形是待确认题目、圆点是你标的重点；时间轴上面的色块是议题，点了从那个议题开始听。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個格式在這裡不能匯出": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This format can't be exported here"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个格式在这里不能导出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個版本沒有更新金鑰（開發版），不會檢查更新。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This build has no update key (development build), so it doesn't check for updates."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个版本没有更新密钥（开发版），不会检查更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦上找不到 %@；其他支援 MCP 的工具可以用「複製」自己貼上設定。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ not found on this PC. For other tools that support MCP, use Copy and paste the settings yourself."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台电脑上找不到 %@；其他支持 MCP 的工具可以用“复制”自己粘贴设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦已經用 %@ 登入 %@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This PC is signed in as %@ on %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台电脑已经用 %@ 登录 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦找不到 Claude Code（命令列版）。Claude 桌面版不能直接用，請到設定 → 整理工具照說明安裝 Claude Code；或改用 API（填 API key）、選「不整理」": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code (the command-line version) isn't installed on this PC. The Claude desktop app can't be used directly: go to Settings → Summarizer and follow the steps to install Claude Code, or choose an API (with an API key) or “Don't summarize”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台电脑找不到 Claude Code（命令行版）。Claude 桌面版不能直接用，请到设置 → 整理工具照说明安装 Claude Code；或改用 API（填 API key）、选“不整理”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦找不到 claude。沒有在用 Claude Code 的話，請到設定 → 整理工具改用 API（填 API key）或選「不整理」": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "claude isn't installed on this PC. If you don't use Claude Code, go to Settings → Summarizer and choose an API (with an API key) or “Don't summarize”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台电脑找不到 claude。没有在用 Claude Code 的话，请到设置 → 整理工具改用 API（填 API key）或选“不整理”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦找不到 codex。沒有在用 Codex 的話，請到設定 → 整理工具改用 API（填 API key）或選「不整理」": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
