    "這台電腦的顯示卡沒有通過檢查（沒有比 CPU 快、結果跟 CPU 不一樣，或出錯）：正式轉錄用 CPU。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This PC’s GPU didn’t pass the check (it wasn’t faster than the CPU, its results didn’t match, or it hit an error): final transcription runs on the CPU."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台电脑的显卡没有通过检查（没有比 CPU 快、结果跟 CPU 不一样，或出错）：正式转录用 CPU。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這場會議是在模型下載好之前，用快速辨識轉錄的。可以用 Breeze 重新轉錄，通常比較準。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This meeting was transcribed with Quick recognition before the model finished downloading. Re-transcribing with Breeze is usually more accurate."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这场会议是在模型下载好之前，用快速识别转录的。可以用 Breeze 重新转录，通常比较准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這場會議是在模型下載好之前，用快速辨識轉錄的。可以用 Qwen3-ASR 重新轉錄，通常比較準。": {
