    "遇到問題，可以從設定的「進階」選「回報問題…」，會附上版本和環境（不含會議內容）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If something goes wrong, choose Report a problem… in Settings → Advanced; it includes the version and environment (no meeting content)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遇到问题，可以从设置的“高级”选“反馈问题…”，会附上版本和环境（不含会议内容）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒檢查：下一次正式轉錄時檢查。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not checked yet: it will be checked during the next final transcription."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没检查：下一次正式转录时检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒設定整理工具：錄音、轉錄、逐字稿全部留在這台電腦。選好整理工具之後，才會整理成會議紀錄。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No summarizer is set up yet: recordings, transcription and transcripts all stay on this PC. Meeting notes are created once you choose a summarizer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没设置整理工具：录音、转录、逐字稿全部留在这台电脑。选好整理工具之后，才会整理成会议记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重新打開拾音後換成新的介面語言": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The new interface language takes effect after you reopen Shiyin"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新打开拾音后换成新的界面语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄現場會議或你自己的聲音。Windows 的「隱私權與安全性 → 麥克風」要允許桌面 app 使用麥克風。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records in-person meetings or your own voice. In Windows Settings → Privacy & security → Microphone, desktop apps must be allowed to use the microphone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录现场会议或你自己的声音。Windows 的“隐私与安全性 → 麦克风”要允许桌面 app 使用麦克风。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄線上會議時選「麥克風＋電腦聲音」：你的聲音和對方的聲音會分別錄在左右聲道。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For online meetings choose “Microphone + computer audio”: your voice and the other side are recorded on the left and right channels."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录线上会议时选“麦克风＋电脑声音”：你的声音和对方的声音会分别录在左右声道。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄線上會議（Zoom、Meet、Teams）對方的聲音。Windows 不用另外允許，錄音時選「麥克風＋電腦聲音」就好。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records the other side of online meetings (Zoom, Meet, Teams). Windows needs no extra permission — just choose “Microphone + computer audio” when recording."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录线上会议（Zoom、Meet、Teams）对方的声音。Windows 不用另外允许，录音时选“麦克风＋电脑声音”就好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音、逐字稿和會議紀錄都只存在這台電腦上（%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Shiyin），不會跟著帳號漫遊。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings, transcripts and meeting notes are stored only on this PC (%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Shiyin) and don't roam with your account."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音、逐字稿和会议记录都只存在这台电脑上（%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Shiyin），不会跟着账号漫游。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中按 Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B 標記重點（在其他 app 裡也能用）": {
